  "question": {
    "text": "A hypothetical electromagnetic wave is show below.\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/r4PCdkPiV2bLibwC2FVSi-4LDUaoYDxCrgjDSBLXdFo.original.fullsize.png\"><br />The frequency of the wave is \\(x \\times 10^{19} \\mathrm{~Hz}\\).\n\\(x =\\) ______ (nearest integer)",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned} & \\lambda=1.5 \\times 4 \\mathrm{pm} \\\\ &=6 \\times 10^{-12} \\text { meter } \\\\ & \\lambda v=\\mathrm{C} \\\\ & 6 \\times 10^{-12} \\times v=3 \\times 10^8 \\\\ & v=5 \\times 10^{19} \\mathrm{~Hz}\\end{aligned}$",
